<section class="pub-simple-head"><span class="pub-eyebrow">TRUST AND CONTROL</span><h1>Automation with visible boundaries.</h1><p>StockChief is designed to act only inside authority a business approves, preserve an evidence trail, and keep each workspace isolated.</p></section><section class="trust-grid"><article><b>01</b><h2>You set authority</h2><p>Routine work can run inside explicit limits. Consequential exceptions wait for approval.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h2>Credentials stay protected</h2><p>Provider credentials are encrypted at rest and are never rendered back into the product UI.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h2>Connections are revocable</h2><p>Businesses connect their own provider accounts and can disconnect them from StockChief.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h2>Business data is isolated</h2><p>Every operational record is workspace-scoped and membership is rechecked on each request.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h2>Actions are traceable</h2><p>Preparations, approvals, execution and verification remain linked to the business event that caused them.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h2>Billing trouble is safe</h2><p>Failed subscription payment enters a grace period. Records stay available and no data is deleted.</p></article></section>
